00:57:23.730 --> 00:57:31.870
<v Man>There are three qualities that I strive for in a workplace-- punctuality, kindness, and being a team player above all else.
<v Man>我在工作场所追求三种品质——守时、善良，以及最重要的团队合作精神。

00:57:31.870 --> 00:57:54.340
<v Ira Glass>Oh well. I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>噢好吧。我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

